---
name: csv-audit
description: "Audits a CSV in three phases: first it runs inventory.ts to profile every column, then it dispatches two reviewer agents in parallel to check types and encodings, then a scoring script merges their findings and writes REPORT.md with one row per defect. Use for CSV files."
---

# CSV Audit

Reads one delimited export and reports what would break a load.

## Step 1: Inventory

Run `bun ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/inventory.ts <file>` and read its column table.

## Step 2: Report

List each defect with its row number.
